# Whitelist: the build context is the repo root, so ignore everything and re-include what images need.
# Each Dockerfile also has its own, tighter docker/<name>.Dockerfile.dockerignore, which BuildKit
# prefers over this file. This one is the fallback for ad-hoc builds.
**

!backend/apps/app/build/libs/*.jar
!contracts/**
!workers/**
!web/**

# Never in any context, even inside re-included trees.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
